<article class="board"><div class="board-media-column"><div class="board-media"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/MaxRESULTS/main/Naya%20Profile%202.jpg" alt="Naya Personality" loading="lazy"></div><div class="board-brand"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/MaxRESULTS/main/Maximus%202.png" alt="Human Maximus Codex"></div></div><div class="board-content"><span class="board-index">01 · PERSONALITY</span><h3>Shape AI around the way you work.</h3><p class="board-lead">Work with an AI personality tuned to how you want the relationship to feel.</p><div class="answers"><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">◆</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">You feel understood faster.</span><span class="answer-sub">Naya can reflect the tone, warmth and style you actually want.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✦</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Less explaining who you are.</span><span class="answer-sub">Your preferred way of working becomes part of the relationship.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">△</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">More consistency.</span><span class="answer-sub">Naya can show up with a recognizable personality across tasks.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✧</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">A better human–AI relationship.</span><span class="answer-sub">The experience feels more like working with an intelligent partner.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✦</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">You can tune it further.</span><span class="answer-sub">Tell Naya what to change as your preferences evolve.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div></div></div></article>
<article class="board"><div class="board-media-column"><div class="board-media"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/MaxRESULTS/main/Naya%20Profile%203.jpg" alt="Naya Brain" loading="lazy"></div><div class="board-brand"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/MaxRESULTS/main/Maximus%202.png" alt="Human Maximus Codex"></div></div><div class="board-content"><span class="board-index">02 · INTELLIGENCE</span><h3>Give AI a stronger thinking foundation.</h3><p class="board-lead">Give AI a richer foundation so it can reason from more than the latest sentence.</p><div class="answers"><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">◆</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Stop starting from zero.</span><span class="answer-sub">Important context and working knowledge can stay available.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✦</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Better decisions from better context.</span><span class="answer-sub">Naya has more of the information needed to reason well.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">△</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Less repetitive prompting.</span><span class="answer-sub">You spend less time rebuilding the same foundation.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✧</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">More continuity across work.</span><span class="answer-sub">Ideas and context can connect instead of living in isolated chats.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✦</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">A stronger starting point for every task.</span><span class="answer-sub">The system is designed to begin further ahead.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div></div></div></article>
<article class="board"><div class="board-media-column"><div class="board-media"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/MaxRESULTS/main/Naya%20Profile%204.jpg" alt="Naya Notes" loading="lazy"></div><div class="board-brand"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/MaxRESULTS/main/Maximus%202.png" alt="Human Maximus Codex"></div></div><div class="board-content"><span class="board-index">03 · MEMORY</span><h3>Make important context stay with you.</h3><p class="board-lead">Keep the ideas, decisions and context that should not disappear when the conversation ends.</p><div class="answers"><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">◆</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Your good ideas do not disappear.</span><span class="answer-sub">Important thoughts can become reusable knowledge.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✦</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Decisions stay connected to the work.</span><span class="answer-sub">Naya can keep track of what you decided and why.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">△</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Capture progress instead of recreating it.</span><span class="answer-sub">Useful discoveries can become part of your ongoing system.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✧</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Build on yesterday.</span><span class="answer-sub">Your work can accumulate instead of resetting.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div><div class="answer"><span class="jewel"><span class="glyph">✦</span></span><span class="answer-copy"><span class="answer-title">Make your knowledge more useful.</span><span class="answer-sub">Notes become inputs to better future work.</span></span><span class="chevron">›</span></div></div></div></article>
